{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0243_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "b8e8e2c563459a7be47e0fd521e282190d6022fd8dac87e6fc36c77a5db8dad4", "ja": "ギクッ！　{$P$}さん！？\n待ってください、これは……その違うんです！", "zh": "糟、{$P$}先生！？  \n请等一下，这个……那个，不是这样的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0243_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "4675267bb21eb6c63c2b442bbe42dfeb2ead58085b3b65baba5cd6ff246ab69c", "ja": "ふ、深いわけがありまして……そ、そう！　衣装！\n細部まで作り込まれた衣装が最高すぎるんですっ！", "zh": "有、有很深的原因……对、对了！是服装！\n连细节都精心打磨的服装，实在是太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0243_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "57186c20f6f25572331de26bc6ae66cc1a2cd4f6ca5f67841f7ae849947c9a45", "ja": "至高の衣装を纏って演技する姿は、どれも神シーン！\nそれを撮らずして、ファンが名乗れますか！？", "zh": "穿着至高礼服演戏的样子，每一个都是神级场面！\n不拍下来，怎么能自称粉丝！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0243_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ea8f1fd8ea26c726871b08014f28793433b38870664c66b9c373f31f96fca699", "ja": "名乗れますかと言われてもな。\nいつもの撮影風景と変わらないと思うけど……。", "zh": "你就算问我够不够格……\n我也觉得和往常的拍摄现场没什么区别就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0243_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "e94bfadd9bed0723593bf05c7877b9eacca48a9b1baa4ec1551cdc2855d30acb", "ja": "大違いですっ！　非日常的な世界観の中で、\n普段と違う顔を見せるアイドルちゃんは特別です！", "zh": "那可完全不一样！在这种非日常的世界观中，展现出与平时不同一面的偶像们，是特别的存在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0243_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "2b01e3350b562fd93dfb8a3bb0a97b399247fab5804ed668071911783f1b2157", "ja": "ありさは、この場所にいられる者として！　この！\n尊い！　光景を！　残さなければならないんです！", "zh": "亚利沙作为能够身处此地的人！必须！\n把这！尊贵的！景象！记录下来才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0243_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1cb963d52128796c09f69ba4793fc438369b0e9de09fb3767ed573b25e2601dc", "ja": "そ、そうか。亜利沙も仕事はちゃんとしてるしな。\nいい写真を撮って……あ、そうだ。", "zh": "这、这样啊。亚利沙工作也一直很认真嘛。拍张好照片……啊，对了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0243_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0bf4f98f7fadd2e07eb4bc51c4cdb23275c86b7323e042191157b2d741b6e1b6", "ja": "せっかくだから、亜利沙の写真、\nファンのみんなに見てもらわないか？", "zh": "难得有这个机会，要不要让粉丝们也看看亜利沙的照片？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0243_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0243_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "0bc6957443b148da19dffd37e2a5cfca255757ac5eb8de60adeeb49e06ab89e9", "ja": "へっ？　この写真をですか……？", "zh": "诶？要把这张照片……给大家看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
